      "eveningPrayer": "Lord, the evening sacrifice has come. I lift my hands one last time before sleep — thankful for the prayers You heard today, and for the ones I forgot to pray. Gather up my scattered words and half-formed hopes; You understand them all. Let me end this day as I began it, in Your presence, at peace. Amen.",
      "reflection": "When during an ordinary day do you find it easiest to turn toward God in prayer — and what tends to pull you away?"
